Baeshra and Goose are on a team by default.

Everyone will get bites at Ozgur's Luau after judging ends

"You will have 15 minutes to plan in your teams."

"Alright, Goose, Wynne and Baeshra are team 1, Skitter Wren and Selene are team 2, Web and Ozgur are team 3"

